{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_009kyj_01_1_2_009_01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:29e347a5907048937b6bbf07d234de78a8433ab57d10753f72c443ee308df73d",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_01_1_2_009_01:1_2_009_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c78fa0276d8d4839a07fc1e6bd5d251d2c5a02105abf371bce5a9d007a073ea5",
      "text": "如今的我之所以能站在这里",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_01_1_2_009_01:1_2_009_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:05105e4f683066fb77210a1fb48eeb8065fe66b2081371ad5723b96b4ae810bf",
      "text": "工作结束后回家的路上，恭二和制作人顺路去了\n书店。恭二在那里购买的，\n是刊登了他们Beit专访的杂志。\n明明应该已经拿到样刊了，\n为什么还要再买一本呢……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_01_1_2_009_01:1_2_009_01_a:cmd-000010:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7824b3a8948acd2c72636875e79b09adab6d8fca3c20b65cfcfd68e8d3eae4ba",
      "text": "第1话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_01_1_2_009_01:1_2_009_01_a:cmd-000010:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c78fa0276d8d4839a07fc1e6bd5d251d2c5a02105abf371bce5a9d007a073ea5",
      "text": "如今的我之所以能站在这里",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_01_1_2_009_01:1_2_009_01_a:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9dae135b58c714d5305f88980a0d485a1f3e4be69668453325c3496ca4aacfa3",
      "text": "辛苦了。\n那我们就回事务所吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_01_1_2_009_01:1_2_009_01_a:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9ee6f12c18f1fdec3917171d95743c998ca4648b9cf8775da987dbd0c8281cdb",
      "text": "在那之前，能顺便去一趟书店吗？\n我有想买的书。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_01_1_2_009_01:1_2_009_01_a:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:291d39c61f44ebd701d679b8f7527aac70d7b10136e2580dc69ab0e9be06cf76",
      "text": "当然可以。要是跟工作相关的书，\n我这边可以报销哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_01_1_2_009_01:1_2_009_01_a:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1c80510f8cd2afa3287317cea97d10ec79488b7210df62bbcfe3c27affd992cd",
      "text": "不用，是私人物品所以不用了。\n只是有本想要的杂志。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_01_1_2_009_01:1_2_009_01_a:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2bbbfb16bd3b3c74f863d41f67719536023a8b68d2fdb7b8d4b5156d13f4b7bc",
      "text": "……不过，让●●●●プロデューサー陪我\n买东西是不是不太好。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_01_1_2_009_01:1_2_009_01_a:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d918aff1466974f813eec5f0ad7c2699edeb9548dc30a967476735abc0d71781",
      "text": "没关系的。\n我陪你一起去！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_01_1_2_009_01:1_2_009_01_a:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:74384850a2908db97e63a31b2b57d5896e0d36dd526abc80dc246010f105e702",
      "text": "这样啊。\n我会尽快买完的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_01_1_2_009_01:1_2_009_01_a:cmd-000052:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d45a8a9885486d392e2da041bd02718ea6476d767986c82fce630e1c9c401798",
      "text": "书店",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_01_1_2_009_01:1_2_009_01_a:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3fcdbba6219dd72ddad5d5968f02fc3b3c0396ed79c2370c8b8932b7c02d66ec",
      "text": "卖场好大啊。\n呃，杂志区是在……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_01_1_2_009_01:1_2_009_01_a:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:db546f618af7b695b870537f6e9639f6f35dc02555afb7416e7fd7d8c7979a42",
      "text": "是那边吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_01_1_2_009_01:1_2_009_01_a:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:407a98b0a41f961998a918f91af330d8977c80310464efcf53ef72481da411f2",
      "text": "应该吧……嗯？\n这本漫画，已经出续集了吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_01_1_2_009_01:1_2_009_01_b:cmd-000012:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:05ba8d3904b54519b3e4a5d07c2bd4c040393426af52e9e31da4619a94e0ac8d",
      "text": "啊，是最近很受热议的漫画呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_01_1_2_009_01:1_2_009_01_b:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bd7ac3b23dcfcd75c2b24a498d180d055d09af599a9827fe3b5599c44bfb7b72",
      "text": "顺便买一本走吧。\n这个月手头还算宽裕……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_01_1_2_009_01:1_2_009_01_b:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:397ea8c91d710dfec397d0847a4b9508fabebeb7222d6b42020ed509b3f0900a",
      "text": "你也读读看吧。\n有多好看我来打包票。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_01_1_2_009_01:1_2_009_01_b:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f94c6e37b15b51d617fcf76ce91312164ffcfb06b57d0568a7b003001d4edf7f",
      "text": "那买几本，\n放在事务所里吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_01_1_2_009_01:1_2_009_01_b:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fdce160aae93a711c537aa1aa90e1232f98a006406d83772f32e7f93218b9838",
      "text": "挺好的啊。\nHigh×Joker那帮家伙应该会很高兴吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_01_1_2_009_01:1_2_009_01_b:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:be5076a00b3421c1d2b4bb0c3315644251166222c61964752cbd682166913381",
      "text": "……对了，游戏杂志他们应该也会喜欢。\n我们事务所里喜欢玩游戏的人挺多的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_01_1_2_009_01:1_2_009_01_b:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6e608681a268691890310599ddd148af65ffb44ae54a26a614abdb62b4e8521d",
      "text": "比如……这款游戏的攻略本之类的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_01_1_2_009_01:1_2_009_01_b:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8c298b74c1a5701050dadfac25a9d33447f70e0dce5b27eeb07b89e767b09162",
      "text": "像、像字典一样厚呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_01_1_2_009_01:1_2_009_01_b:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:19618906ec6324a16c1865d37dd0ae2a9d67307aac4c4cf63e6352f8c7ce8aec",
      "text": "哈哈，是啊。不仅有攻略，\n还刊登了硬核的情报和冷知识呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_01_1_2_009_01:1_2_009_01_c:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ca0092afae1bde09c8dd8ba1c3c0758fb687a5afee04e6856598f416f6fc76ca",
      "text": "像这种花絮一样的内容，\n读起来很有意思对吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_01_1_2_009_01:1_2_009_01_c:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:14a53ab1b9c1116499468bf93e7d7e90affd4a5f300adc02b6fc458b045a339d",
      "text": "是啊。一边看着一边再玩一遍之类的。\n和游戏放在一起的话，大概会很热闹吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_01_1_2_009_01:1_2_009_01_c:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1cb8155934386e1da43aba62bbeb5c8218b93ff0998b0b5afb4de12238c1b016",
      "text": "话说……抱歉，得去杂志区才行。\n呃，是在这背面吗……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_01_1_2_009_01:1_2_009_01_c:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d472b2e1b82c0d0cfda0ddb3c9276b8e9a6c8f81a2bd51611714522b23941a12",
      "text": "这里是……不对，好像是参考书专区呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_01_1_2_009_01:1_2_009_01_c:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7796ce3dcbfd1d985bde24fab04b8318bcf2868add3d4c5a88c22ccd5113954d",
      "text": "啊啊……\n好多高考历年真题集啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_01_1_2_009_01:1_2_009_01_c:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4ca7e5ceaf0ee7c2895ab691e8acb114889e28b85a515c75754c6d0fbe593c7c",
      "text": "大学联考的事，还有老爸的事我都听说了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_01_1_2_009_01:1_2_009_01_c:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3d906bb765107b00038390e2342c595a5f9e6ab99ede6e0eb5ea56e2685769a8",
      "text": "就算你就这样逃避离开，\n也只会变成丧家犬而已。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_01_1_2_009_01:1_2_009_01_c:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:395e1e0587dd4b9f9651c99d8688715f896c700b3636d0c7194d15a0e800904d",
      "text": "…………",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_01_1_2_009_01:1_2_009_01_c:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:921ef916de755cfe42738481c2b51198b9d7813fedb3ad8e95049e1d73f4aca2",
      "text": "恭二先生，怎么了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_01_1_2_009_01:1_2_009_01_c:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b3a7292235434c1fe1ee0432d835f0fd2aa0f6069c45f4162c2daab685f06d04",
      "text": "啊，没……没什么。\n比起这个，看。这边是杂志区。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_01_1_2_009_01:1_2_009_01_d:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6cb24099496e038688ad9ff780262b7c36110fd6783b82ba9701ef257e300e69",
      "text": "太好了。是最后一本。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_01_1_2_009_01:1_2_009_01_d:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:988361cc895faf4cf388fa89cc26f30fafd8b6057a57a409faa36fade66216fb",
      "text": "（咦？那本杂志是……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_01_1_2_009_01:1_2_009_01_d:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:17f99f5839f61879519cf57bd6371741b4eff7acf3167062616ff4837e1c03bd",
      "text": "恭二先生。您刚才买的，\n是刊登了Beit报道的杂志对吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_01_1_2_009_01:1_2_009_01_d:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c1aa6b477bcdf1328940da7dc29b825b740b51594178496d9c4e9d14a429658e",
      "text": "我记得前几天，好像已经\n把样刊交给您了才对……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_01_1_2_009_01:1_2_009_01_d:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:813aa2a0c79d9d28638eac79c45b9627742fd1bcfd9453329910ac2bc425fc4b",
      "text": "是那样没错……但其实啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_01_1_2_009_01:1_2_009_01_d:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c16030e6da98d34422bedb505a4f156490fae58538939929beb55d3c2d8df32f",
      "text": "这本杂志，我想拿去给爷爷和奶奶\n也看看。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_01_1_2_009_01:1_2_009_01_d:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:91446bee4e2864aab4d9e09b84a254f2c4dc7a61f9173886d763fcb151e928d9",
      "text": "……从我离家出走之后，\n让两个人操了不少心。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_01_1_2_009_01:1_2_009_01_d:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:41be5e506799262a50e0137fbae59b5782d1975361879c3fec7fe772f1304f49",
      "text": "我想把工作成果和自己现在过得很好这件事，\n一起告诉他们。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_01_1_2_009_01:1_2_009_01_d:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4ebe39ec449aac32c9da300f91458207a768542cf1ecd36d1b0287933858deac",
      "text": "您非常珍视两位老人家呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_01_1_2_009_01:1_2_009_01_d:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e04ba47ad21444c3b91b9d3484e03114b2b355f082b8802d799e9fedd1b81102",
      "text": "还行吧。\n……我偶尔会去看望那两个人。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_01_1_2_009_01:1_2_009_01_d:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0cccb84c86c1597cc675abac379b59b3c6caded6ca9c26eb668175b0634cb0c0",
      "text": "我也跟他们聊起过制作人哦。说是托你和\nBeit的福，我才能像这样做好偶像工作。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_01_1_2_009_01:1_2_009_01_d:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d938d993f633055f74721b2b34d0bd5d52663d146d8f967694f47cee63916847",
      "text": "拿着这本杂志，很期待久违地去见他们呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_01_1_2_009_01:1_2_009_01_e:cmd-000011:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_01_1_2_009_01:1_2_009_01_e:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:203449cbc5fd80f6115de575dc821b7378b3c487e22c8522ce2db89f450a27bb",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，现在方便吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_01_1_2_009_01:1_2_009_01_e:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0f61cb004e3822d2fc7cc4ee4f9635c083feb81f8148d2378fd24677df34c433",
      "text": "方便，怎么了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_01_1_2_009_01:1_2_009_01_e:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f3283c3272191fb35242f239871b27967fd4a7b6278a979e02cfd60e3bb48f33",
      "text": "昨天我去见爷爷奶奶了。\n然后聊起你的事，他们给了我这个……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_01_1_2_009_01:1_2_009_01_e:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4ed61c57ba66fa0447532c173bdecfb40bb88fd2a9e37014db318f43842dcc0b",
      "text": "点心和信……\n谢谢，那我收下了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_01_1_2_009_01:1_2_009_01_e:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7031d5861dcf30bef03993dd65a059f0c205aee194510171e08eb12bc0d57681",
      "text": "……上面写着“恭二就拜托您了”，\n这样的一句话呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_01_1_2_009_01:1_2_009_01_e:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1c2895cb5606fd44644c9d9a7332775c4ea752c1b01e3d52b418330ace5bf6ba",
      "text": "他们两个说“遇到了个好人呢”。\n……我也这么觉得。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_01_1_2_009_01:1_2_009_01_e:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f03a881aa2d465dfca87e918a394f1d9ca385038f835a5a8aebf04a2d6c4ec3d",
      "text": "虽然你可能会说这是我自己的实力，\n但我能像这样坚持当偶像……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_01_1_2_009_01:1_2_009_01_e:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c4eb01459b9746f3a9eddebc8ca049f36a7bdbc615013ce7fada360795f85f11",
      "text": "都是多亏了实先生、皮埃尔，\n还有你。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_01_1_2_009_01:1_2_009_01_e:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cbbaf56be5e95676cd579dd85aa1781fbee7bda3a1399d542c1b1e9f96ef78cb",
      "text": "那个……可能不太容易看出来，但我真的很感激。\n所以，今后也请多关照了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_009kyj_01_1_2_009_01:1_2_009_01_e:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f3e3a263db9ab38392727d85286f27bacaa71f770ef7e7a3865dbaedc75d5c6b",
      "text": "嗯，当然。\n我才要请您多关照呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
